        :text "compiler_mode=dry_run now renders plan-draft as an executable Lisp scaffold with :target, :objective, and :nodes; execute can derive target_source=plan_hint from plan.sexp_text instead of caller escape parameters. plan/compile_authoring.rs owns mission_plan plan-authoring entry/core: action_compile, action_compile_dry_run, action_compile_sonnet, resolve_dry_run_plan_target, derive_dry_run_plan_objective, and render_dry_run_plan_sexp project compiler_mode dry_run/sonnet into persisted plan rows. plan/compile_authoring/artifact.rs owns plan file-first artifact egress: PlanFileArgs, extract_plan_file_args, and maybe_write_plan_artifact mirror compiled PLAN.lisp under ArtifactKind::Plan while preserving partial-on-file-failure semantics. plan/compile_authoring/validation.rs owns planner prompt and Lisp output validation: collect_string_list, build_planner_system_prompt, build_planner_user_prompt, SexpValidationError, validate_compiled_plan_sexp, strip_fenced_code_block, parens_balanced, and top_level_head keep LLM output constrained to one anchored Lisp plan. plan/approval_review.rs owns mission_plan plan-review-gate caller action facade plus shared PLAN_REVIEW_ACTIONS wiring. plan/approval_review/approve.rs owns mission_plan approve action: action_approve, action_approve_with_resolution, plan_action_approve_with_policy_only, PlanStatus::Approved transition, review-resolution validation, and resolved-event egress. plan/approval_review/mark.rs owns mission_plan mark action: action_mark, action_mark_with_resolution, plan_action_mark_with_policy_only, target_raw parsing, mark-to-approved policy auto-promotion, and resolved-event egress. plan/approval_review/supersede.rs owns mission_plan supersede action: action_supersede, action_supersede_with_resolution, plan_action_supersede_with_policy_only, destructive-action refusal, PlanStatus::Superseded transition, and resolved-event egress. plan/approval_review/proposer.rs owns mission_plan plan-review LLM proposal helpers: build_plan_automation_ctx, request_plan_auto_approve_proposal, attach_plan_proposal_block, attach_plan_apply_gate_block, parse_plan_proposer_mode_or_error, and plan_proposer_summary keep propose-only audit blocks outside the caller action facade. plan/approval_review/subscriber.rs owns mission_plan plan-review subscriber bridge: PlanSubscriberOutcome and handle_review_resolved_event keep approval/rejection/needs_changes transitions tied to the same review envelope validation without bloating the caller action facade. plan/field_inference.rs owns mission_plan execute preflight field inference/core: PlanFieldInference, deterministic field inference, and safe preview response projection before execution. plan/field_inference/mode.rs owns infer_plan_fields/workstation_inference_mode parsing and DAG preflight gates. plan/field_inference/evidence.rs owns evidence-sidecar scanners over top-level and typed_evidence/inner_result holders. plan/field_inference/rules.rs owns deterministic field inference rules: PlanInferenceInput, compute_plan_field_inference, six field inferers, and finalize helpers. plan/field_inference/llm.rs owns Sonnet proposal parsing, validation, conflict reconciliation, prompt construction, gateway request, deterministic coverage labeling, and recent evidence reads for inference; LLM proposals remain surfaced-only unless the apply gate sees explicit caller approval. plan/field_inference/apply.rs owns apply_gate, including explicit apply approval, LLM caller approval, and response block splicing. plan/field_inference/apply/persisted.rs owns persisted_apply, including proposal-hash preflight, PLAN.lisp persisted annotation synthesis, evidence entry construction, and response block splicing. plan/execution_runtime.rs owns mission_plan execute facade orchestration: action_execute preflight, preview/apply branch selection, paused-node resume, DAG handoff, resolved target/strategy selection, workstation proposal/gate attachment, and router/task-runner advisory block splicing while preserving the plan.rs facade. plan/execution_runtime/bridge.rs owns bridge descriptor projection and plan_field_inference response splicing. plan/execution_runtime/internal.rs owns mission_plan internal dispatch runtime: task-contract emit/dry-run, session-trace validation/forwarding, workstation-dispatch substrate handoff, inner handler dispatch, PLAN_RUNNER_EVENT_REF_UNAVAILABLE_REASON, evidence sidecar append, plan status transition, and final response assembly. plan/execution_runtime/workstation.rs owns workstation proposal/auto-spawn execution adjuncts: compute_workstation_proposal_bundle, plan_hints_carry_workstation_signal, attach_workstation_proposals_block, compute_workstation_auto_spawn_gate, and attach_workstation_auto_spawn_gate_block keep proposal/gate blocks isolated from the runtime facade while preserving workstation-dispatch substrate calls. plan/internal_dispatch.rs owns mission_plan inner target argument projection: build_internal_dispatch_args maps Lisp hints and caller args into mission_execution, mission_task_delegate, and mission_flow_run payloads; derive_objective_from_plan/truncate_chars cap delegated objectives; tool_result_payload preserves downstream JSON payload compatibility for plan_dag, workflow, and workstation dispatch. plan/execute_hints.rs owns mission_plan PLAN.lisp hint parsing: ParsedPlanHints, ResolvedExec, parse_plan_hints, scan_keyword_pairs, split_lisp_string_list, normalize_target, canonicalize_strategy, and resolve_dispatch_strategy are the execution-hint boundary shared by mission_plan, plan_dag, and workstation-dispatch brief projection. plan/task_contract.rs owns mission_plan task-contract Lisp projection: TaskContractEmitMode, DispatchContractMode, TaskContractInputs, parse_task_contract_emit_mode, parse_dispatch_contract_mode, build_task_contract_lisp, write_task_contract_under_root, emit_task_contract, task_contract_inputs_from_hints, and task_contract_inputs_from_hints_with_trace produce the generated .missiond/tasks/generated/<plan>/<node>.lisp contract and the optional :session-trace-path projection before workstation dispatch. plan/distill_chain.rs owns mission_plan cross-plan distill-chain egress: parse_distill_chain_mode, validate_distill_chain_args, apply_distill_chain, build_distill_chain_block, and attach_distill_chain_to_payload project finalize-plan success into a typed distill_chain response/evidence record without changing the underlying plan finalization. plan/dispatch_response.rs owns mission_plan execution response egress: validate_session_trace_path_arg, attach_session_trace_response_fields, merge_task_contract_block, build_task_contract_failure_response, build_task_contract_dry_run_response, build_workstation_dispatch_response, and build_internal_dispatch_success_response assemble session-trace, task-contract, workstation-dispatch, and internal-dispatch status fields without changing the core dispatch path. plan/evidence_sidecar.rs owns mission_plan evidence sidecar egress: action_record_evidence and append_plan_evidence_entry persist manual evidence and plan-runner dispatch audit entries under .missiond/v3/runtime/plans with legacy .missiond/v2/plans fallback and typed evidence_collector stamps when evidence_kind/source are supplied. plan/router_policy_dry_run.rs owns the mission_plan router-policy adapter: parse_router_policy_mode, attach_router_recommendation_block, and compute_recommendation_block keep dry-run/off-mode orchestration in the facade. plan/router_policy_dry_run/predicate.rs owns router-policy predicate projection: project_context, evaluate_clause, arg_string, and glob_match convert live execution context into Lisp rule matching decisions. plan/router_policy_dry_run/readiness.rs owns router-policy trace-index/backend-readiness projection: load_trace_index, load_backend_registry, attach_trace_index_fields, attach_backend_readiness_fields, and recommendation block builders project advisory Lisp facts while keeping applied=false, no runtime replacement, and byte-identical off mode. plan/router_policy_dry_run/descriptor.rs owns router dispatch descriptor projection: attach_router_dispatch_descriptor emits missiond.router-dispatch-descriptor.v1 with locked dry_run_only/runtime_replacement/no_execution invariants. plan/router_policy_dry_run/schema_parser.rs owns the router-policy Lisp schema parser shared by the policy and backend-registry advisory projections. plan/task_runner_dry_run.rs owns the mission_plan task-runner adapter: parse_task_runner_mode, attach_task_runner_block, and compute_runner_block keep dry-run/off-mode orchestration in the facade. plan/task_runner_dry_run/manifest.rs owns task-runner manifest loading/parsing: load_runner_inputs, ManifestStatus, Manifest, ManifestNode, parse_manifest, parse_node_entry, and the self-contained Lisp token cursor project manifest files into typed Rust inputs. plan/task_runner_dry_run/projection.rs owns task-runner manifest response projection: build_runner_response_block, project_manifest, critical path, tier counts, batching, and overlap diagnostics emit the advisory task_runner block while keeping applied=false, no worker spawn, and byte-identical off mode. plan/tests.rs holds the historical mission_plan regression suite outside the runtime facade so plan.rs remains a small action router and module boundary. plan_dag/runtime.rs owns the DAG live runtime wave loop: execute_with_concurrency, ready wave drain, claim acquisition/release, dispatch JoinSet, retry spawning, acceptance fan-in, rollback/cascade execution, taint propagation, and topological outcome stitching live outside the action facade. plan_dag/parser.rs is the DAG parser/validator facade; plan_dag/parser/types.rs is the DAG parser types facade; plan_dag/parser/types/node.rs owns DAG node shapes and typed hint projections: DagNode, ParsedDag, ReviewGateKind, review/retry constants, acceptance/review/retry helpers. plan_dag/parser/types/errors.rs owns DAG build error egress: DagBuildError and into_tool_result. plan_dag/parser/scanner.rs is the DAG scanner facade; plan_dag/parser/scanner/top_level.rs owns top-level PLAN.lisp S-expression scanning: parse_plan_dag, scan_top_level_forms, top_form_head, and unsupported top-form capture. plan_dag/parser/scanner/node_form.rs owns node form keyword lowering: parse_node_form, set_first, typed acceptance/rollback hint parsing, unsupported_fields, and DagNode construction. plan_dag/parser/scanner/lists.rs owns DAG id-list parsing. plan_dag/parser/scanner/keyword_pairs.rs owns Lisp keyword/value token scanning. plan_dag/parser/validation.rs owns DAG contract validation/topological ordering: build_validated_dag, target/dependency/retry/fan-in/compensate validation, transitive ancestor checks, and Kahn topo sort. plan_dag/acceptance.rs is the DAG acceptance facade; plan_dag/acceptance/types.rs owns typed acceptance contracts: acceptance-mode, acceptance-requires, status projection, evaluation JSON, and fan-in JSON. plan_dag/acceptance/evaluator.rs owns per-node acceptance evaluation. plan_dag/acceptance/fan_in.rs owns cross-node acceptance fan-in. plan_dag/acceptance/payload.rs owns inner-payload signal/key scanning. plan_dag/acceptance/pause.rs owns deterministic acceptance pause ids. plan_dag/claim_lease.rs owns the DAG claim/lease core: claim_lease_secs, claimer_name, enforce_claims, scope derivation, deterministic claim ids, ClaimRegistry conflict detection, and planned claim projection. plan_dag/dispatch.rs is the DAG node dispatch facade. plan_dag/dispatch/types.rs owns DAG dispatch outcome shape: DispatchOutcome, inner_payload, classification, and non_retryable projection. plan_dag/dispatch/workstation.rs owns workstation hint/outcome projection: node_to_workstation_hints, workstation_outcome_to_dispatch_pair, workstation dispatch envelope merge, and safe-descriptor non-retryable classification. plan_dag/dispatch/task_contract_ctx.rs owns per-run task-contract dispatch context: TaskContractDispatchCtx, task_contract_mode parsing, dispatch_contract_mode parsing, and project/cwd signal capture. plan_dag/dispatch/runner.rs owns DAG node dispatch execution: dispatch_node, task-contract emission, workstation-dispatch handoff, and internal mission_execution/mission_task_delegate/mission_flow_run handler calls stay outside the scheduler loop. plan_dag/rollback.rs is the DAG rollback facade; plan_dag/rollback/types.rs is the rollback types facade; plan_dag/rollback/types/node_ext.rs owns DagNode rollback hint projections: rollback_policy_kind, rollback_cascade_kind, has_active_rollback_cascade, and has_rollback_hints. plan_dag/rollback/types/policy.rs owns rollback policy parsing. plan_dag/rollback/types/evaluation.rs owns node-local rollback evaluation JSON: RollbackStatus, RollbackEvaluation, is_inactive, and to_json. plan_dag/rollback/types/cascade.rs owns cascade rollback outcome JSON: RollbackCascadeMode, CascadeCompensationOutcome, CascadeRollbackOutcome, is_inactive, and to_json. plan_dag/rollback/descriptor.rs owns rollback descriptor and pre-dispatch safety: build_rollback_descriptor, RollbackDescriptor, workstation hints, safety checks, and pre_dispatch_rollback_decision. plan_dag/rollback/run.rs owns node-local rollback execution: run_rollback, workstation-dispatch outcome mapping, and rollback brief preview truncation. plan_dag/rollback/cascade.rs is the DAG cascade rollback facade. plan_dag/rollback/cascade/ordering.rs owns compensation ordering: compute_compensation_order, rollback_after edges, forward compensate-node refs, and deterministic fallback ordering. plan_dag/rollback/cascade/plan_entry.rs owns plan-mode compensation projection: build_compensation_plan_entry, descriptor projection, task brief preview, and descriptor_ready status. plan_dag/rollback/cascade/runner.rs owns dispatch-safe cascade execution: run_cascade_rollback, compensation loop, safety gate handling, and cascade summary reason. plan_dag/rollback/cascade/dispatch_outcome.rs owns workstation-dispatch outcome mapping: map_dispatch_outcome_to_compensation, dispatched/dry-run/inner-error/safe-descriptor projection, and brief preview truncation. plan_dag/resume.rs is the DAG review-resume facade; plan_dag/resume/validation.rs owns resume id validation and error vocabulary; plan_dag/resume/action.rs owns explicit resume action entry/egress; plan_dag/resume/evidence.rs owns resume decision evidence; plan_dag/resume/listener.rs owns bus-resolved plan-node resume bridge: PlanNodeResumeError, validate_resume_request, action_execute_resume, resume decision evidence, PlanNodeResumeListenerOutcome, and handle_review_resolved_plan_node_event keep explicit execute resumes and bus-resolved plan-node resumes on the same validator/dispatch path. plan_dag/outcome.rs is the DAG node outcome facade; plan_dag/outcome/state.rs owns node state/lifecycle enums; plan_dag/outcome/node_result.rs owns node result shape/defaults; plan_dag/outcome/execution.rs owns DAG execution outcome response projection: NodeState, NodeLifecycle, NodeResult, ExecutionOutcome, node_results_json, paused/skipped node projection, aggregate_status, runner_status, and target_plan_status keep response semantics outside the runtime loop. plan_dag/projection.rs owns the DAG response projection core: node summaries, retry plan projection, and unsupported hint summary preserve dry-run/live response shape outside the runtime loop. plan_dag/finalization.rs owns the DAG finalization projection core: finalize_plan and distill_on_success parsing, plan status label mapping, finalization response blocks, distill response blocks, and maybe_run_distill_trigger workflow egress stay outside the scheduler loop. plan_dag/lifecycle.rs is the DAG lifecycle facade. plan_dag/lifecycle/context.rs owns per-run evidence context: EvidenceCtx keeps plan_id, plan_version, project_arg, cwd_arg, and target_project_arg shared by every evidence row. plan_dag/lifecycle/event_ref.rs owns deterministic event refs and bus publish fallback: deterministic PlanNodeStateChanged ids, build_plan_node_state_changed_event, publish_plan_node_state_change, resolver recovery, and EventRef stamping stay outside row builders. plan_dag/lifecycle/finalize.rs owns dag_finalized evidence rows. plan_dag/lifecycle/nodes.rs is the DAG node evidence row facade; plan_dag/lifecycle/nodes/running.rs owns ready->running evidence rows; plan_dag/lifecycle/nodes/finished.rs owns running->finished evidence rows; plan_dag/lifecycle/nodes/rollback.rs owns failed->rollback evidence rows; plan_dag/lifecycle/nodes/acceptance.rs owns succeeded->acceptance evidence rows; plan_dag/lifecycle/nodes/skipped.rs owns pending->skipped evidence rows. plan_dag/lifecycle/retry.rs owns retry attempt constants and retry predicate. plan_dag/lifecycle/review.rs owns paused review-gate evidence rows. plan_dag/lifecycle/claims.rs owns the DAG claim lifecycle evidence rows: pending->claimed, claimed->released, pending->failed claim_conflict, and claim metadata projection. plan_dag/scheduler.rs owns the DAG scheduler projection core: dry-run concurrency wave projection, max_parallel_nodes parsing, taint propagation, and per-node inner argument projection stay outside the runtime loop. plan_dag/mode.rs owns the DAG scheduler-mode gate: scheduler_mode detection and DAG-mode LLM inference refusal stay as the facade-level handoff guard before runtime dispatch. plan_dag/tests.rs does the same for the DAG scheduler regression suite while plan_dag.rs continues to own the action facade and dry-run/finalization glue. DAG execution parses node-local Lisp hints (:target, :objective, :timeout-ms, :target-project, :requested-cwd, :acceptance-commands, :workstation-dispatch) and forwards them into the same internal dispatch path. unified_entry owns only routing/argument forwarding: s4 compile forwards target/objective/project hints into mission_plan, and s6 execute forwards approved_plan_id + execute=true knobs without inventing a secon